{"id":"giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2","lines":[{"t":1.773,"end":8.037,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[angrily] Shut up! Just shut up!","de":"[wütend] Halt die Klappe! Halt einfach die Klappe!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/001.mp3"},{"t":7.804,"end":14.884,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[seething] Don't you dare even speak his name!","de":"[brodelnd] Wagen Sie es nicht einmal, seinen Namen auszusprechen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/002.mp3"},{"t":15.387,"end":17.355,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"What's the matter?","de":"Was ist los?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/003.mp3"},{"t":17.087,"end":21.407,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I'm only paying the man a compliment. I'm being sincere.","de":"Ich mache dem Mann nur ein Kompliment. Ich bin aufrichtig.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/004.mp3"},{"t":21.201,"end":23.433,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"These are high words of praise.","de":"Das sind große Worte des Lobes.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/005.mp3"},{"t":23.197,"end":27.325,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"You're wrong. All you're doing is insulting him!","de":"Du liegst falsch. Du beleidigst ihn nur!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/006.mp3"},{"t":27.041,"end":31.289,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"You're just spitting on his memory. On all of us!","de":"Du spuckst nur auf sein Andenken. Auf uns alle!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/007.mp3"},{"t":31.683,"end":34.779,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"You couldn't be more wrong, Tanjiro.","de":"Du könntest nicht falscher liegen, Tanjiro.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/008.mp3"},{"t":34.549,"end":39.493,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"As you'll recall, the only thing I despise is weak human beings.","de":"Wie Sie sich erinnern, verachte ich nur schwache Menschen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/009.mp3"},{"t":39.426,"end":44.466,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Only a feeble weakling is deserving of my scorn and no one else.","de":"Nur ein schwacher Schwächling verdient meine Verachtung und niemand sonst.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/010.mp3"},{"t":44.724,"end":50.172,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"That's right. The mere sight of them makes my skin crawl.","de":"Das ist richtig. Allein ihr Anblick löst in mir eine Gänsehaut aus.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/011.mp3"},{"t":50.193,"end":52.137,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"They make me retch!","de":"Sie bringen mich zum Würgen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/012.mp3"},{"t":52.883,"end":57.635,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Through the laws of nature, they are weeded out from this world just as they should be.","de":"Durch die Naturgesetze werden sie genau so aus dieser Welt ausgesondert, wie es sein sollte.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/013.mp3"},{"t":58.224,"end":61.92,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Everything you just said is wrong!","de":"Alles, was Sie gerade gesagt haben, ist falsch!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/014.mp3"},{"t":61.485,"end":64.077,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Huh?","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/015.mp3"},{"t":64.529,"end":69.257,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"The fact you're even alive right now, isn't that proof enough?","de":"Ist die Tatsache, dass Sie gerade noch am Leben sind, nicht Beweis genug?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/016.mp3"},{"t":70.292,"end":73.628,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"As an infant, we're all helpless.","de":"Als Kleinkind sind wir alle hilflos.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/017.mp3"},{"t":73.435,"end":76.339,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"We can't live without someone else's help.","de":"Wir können nicht ohne die Hilfe anderer leben.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/018.mp3"},{"t":76.127,"end":78.647,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"You're no different, Akaza.","de":"Du bist nicht anders, Akaza.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/019.mp3"},{"t":79.076,"end":81.74,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Even if you don't remember,","de":"Auch wenn du dich nicht erinnerst,","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/020.mp3"},{"t":81.497,"end":85.337,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"there was a time when you were protected and cared for by someone.","de":"Es gab eine Zeit, in der man von jemandem beschützt und umsorgt wurde.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/021.mp3"},{"t":85.118,"end":86.534,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"I know it!","de":"Ich weiß es!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/022.mp3"},{"t":86.654,"end":88.502,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"That's why you're alive.","de":"Deshalb lebst du.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/023.mp3"},{"t":93.168,"end":96.456,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"The strong should aid and protect the weak.","de":"Die Starken sollten den Schwachen helfen und sie beschützen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/024.mp3"},{"t":96.342,"end":101.838,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"And in turn, the weak become strong and aid and protect those weaker than themselves!","de":"Und im Gegenzug werden die Schwachen stark und helfen und beschützen diejenigen, die schwächer sind als sie selbst!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/025.mp3"},{"t":102.265,"end":104.641,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"That is the law of nature.","de":"Das ist das Naturgesetz.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/026.mp3"},{"t":105.233,"end":108.809,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Akaza, I can't tolerate your way of thinking.","de":"Akaza, ich kann deine Denkweise nicht tolerieren.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/027.mp3"},{"t":109.431,"end":113.271,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Here on out, I won't let you do as you please!","de":"Ich lasse dich nicht machen, was du willst!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/028.mp3"},{"t":117.861,"end":120.813,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I get it now.","de":"Ich verstehe es jetzt.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/029.mp3"},{"t":122.704,"end":127.336,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I have a disgust for this boy that's almost primal in nature.","de":"Ich hege einen Abscheu vor diesem Jungen, der fast ursprünglicher Natur ist.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/030.mp3"},{"t":127.685,"end":131.789,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Even if he's stronger, that feeling hasn't faded.","de":"Auch wenn er stärker ist, ist dieses Gefühl nicht verschwunden.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/031.mp3"},{"t":136.55,"end":141.662,"chars":[2],"who":"Keizo aka Dojo Mentor","text":"No matter who they are, everyone begins life as a newborn.","de":"Egal wer sie sind, jeder beginnt sein Leben als Neugeborener.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/032.mp3"},{"t":141.446,"end":145.334,"chars":[2],"who":"Keizo aka Dojo Mentor","text":"We learn by getting help from those around us.","de":"Wir lernen, indem wir Hilfe von unseren Mitmenschen erhalten.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/033.mp3"},{"t":145.381,"end":148.861,"chars":[2],"who":"Keizo aka Dojo Mentor","text":"We are not competing with others.","de":"Wir konkurrieren nicht mit anderen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/034.mp3"},{"t":148.517,"end":152.477,"chars":[2],"who":"Keizo aka Dojo Mentor","text":"The only opponent you have in life is yourself.","de":"Der einzige Gegner, den du im Leben hast, bist du selbst.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/035.mp3"},{"t":152.337,"end":157.065,"chars":[2],"who":"Keizo aka Dojo Mentor","text":"Just focus on becoming stronger than you were yesterday.","de":"Konzentrieren Sie sich einfach darauf, stärker zu werden, als Sie es gestern waren.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/036.mp3"},{"t":157.734,"end":163.638,"chars":[2],"who":"Keizo aka Dojo Mentor","text":"If you can stay this path for a decade or even two, that would be commendable","de":"Wenn Sie diesen Weg ein oder zwei Jahrzehnte lang durchhalten können, wäre das lobenswert","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/037.mp3"},{"t":163.517,"end":168.221,"chars":[2],"who":"Keizo aka Dojo Mentor","text":"And before you know it, you will be helping others in turn.","de":"Und bevor Sie es merken, helfen Sie wiederum anderen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/038.mp3"},{"t":168.227,"end":171.923,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[breathing shakily]","de":"[atmet zitternd]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/039.mp3"},{"t":173.892,"end":175.38,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[gasps]","de":"[keucht]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/040.mp3"},{"t":175.959,"end":177.351,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"What was that?","de":"Was war das?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/041.mp3"},{"t":177.182,"end":179.39,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"He just swung his fist at nothing.","de":"Er schwang einfach seine Faust ins Nichts.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/042.mp3"},{"t":184.815,"end":186.783,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Tanjiro.","de":"Tanjiro.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/043.mp3"},{"t":186.909,"end":190.485,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"You still repulse me to my core.","de":"Du stößt mich immer noch bis ins Mark ab.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/044.mp3"},{"t":191.619,"end":194.139,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Destructive Death, Crushing Type:","de":"Zerstörerischer Tod, vernichtender Typ:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/045.mp3"},{"t":194.215,"end":196.711,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Ten Thousand Leaves Flashing Willow!","de":"Zehntausend Blätter blinkende Weide!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/046.mp3"},{"t":199.765,"end":202.021,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"This speed, it's blinding!","de":"Diese Geschwindigkeit ist blendend!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/047.mp3"},{"t":201.861,"end":204.405,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"No, it's not just his speed.","de":"Nein, es liegt nicht nur an seiner Geschwindigkeit.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/048.mp3"},{"t":204.298,"end":208.066,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"It's his precision, his aura, and also--","de":"Es ist seine Präzision, seine Aura und auch--","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/049.mp3"},{"t":210.313,"end":211.537,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[grunts]","de":"[grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/050.mp3"},{"t":211.322,"end":212.546,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[gasp]","de":"[keuch]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/051.mp3"},{"t":212.188,"end":214.996,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Destructive Death, Leg type:","de":"Zerstörerischer Tod, Beintyp:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/052.mp3"},{"t":214.619,"end":215.843,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Below.","de":"Unten.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/053.mp3"},{"t":218.02,"end":220.612,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Flying Planet Thousand Wheels!","de":"Fliegender Planet Tausend Räder!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/054.mp3"},{"t":224.79,"end":231.75,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[scoff] Even if I could anticipate his strikes, they're so powerful, I can't completely deflect them.","de":"[spöttisch] Selbst wenn ich seine Schläge vorhersehen könnte, sind sie so mächtig, dass ich sie nicht vollständig abwehren kann.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/055.mp3"},{"t":231.517,"end":237.181,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"His techniques are so precise, they can pierce through any opening, no matter how small.","de":"Seine Techniken sind so präzise, ​​dass sie jede noch so kleine Öffnung durchdringen können.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/056.mp3"},{"t":238.972,"end":240.244,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/057.mp3"},{"t":239.949,"end":244.701,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"It's like a magnet is attracting his attacks straight toward my weak points.","de":"Es ist, als würde ein Magnet seine Angriffe direkt auf meine Schwachstellen ziehen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/058.mp3"},{"t":244.54,"end":247.9,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"But how? What's happening?","de":"Aber wie? Was passiert?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/059.mp3"},{"t":247.633,"end":250.273,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"What could be causing this behavior","de":"Was könnte dieses Verhalten verursachen?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/060.mp3"},{"t":250.085,"end":252.773,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Come on. Think.","de":"Komm schon. Denken.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/061.mp3"},{"t":254.129,"end":255.641,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"What's the answer?!","de":"Was ist die Antwort?!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/062.mp3"},{"t":255.448,"end":259.096,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"There must be a clue in what Akaza's said or done.","de":"Es muss einen Hinweis darauf geben, was Akaza gesagt oder getan hat.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/063.mp3"},{"t":258.88,"end":261.376,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunts] HYAH!","de":"[grunzt] HYAH!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/064.mp3"},{"t":262.276,"end":264.172,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Hinokami Kagura:","de":"Hinokami Kagura:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/065.mp3"},{"t":263.904,"end":266.064,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Solar Heat Haze!","de":"Sonnenhitze-Dunst!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/066.mp3"},{"t":275.258,"end":278.522,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[chuckles] What an interesting move.","de":"[kichert] Was für ein interessanter Schachzug.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/067.mp3"},{"t":278.341,"end":282.373,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I dodged it at first, but then the blade seemed to extend.","de":"Zuerst wich ich ihm aus, aber dann schien sich die Klinge auszufahren.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/068.mp3"},{"t":282.132,"end":284.796,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I don't know what kind of swing you put behind it,","de":"Ich weiß nicht, was für einen Schwung du dahinter steckst,","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/069.mp3"},{"t":284.606,"end":288.182,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"but the tip of your blade wavered like it was in a heat haze.","de":"aber die Spitze deiner Klinge schwankte, als wäre sie in einem Hitzeflimmern.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/070.mp3"},{"t":287.868,"end":289.812,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"How fascinating!","de":"Wie faszinierend!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/071.mp3"},{"t":289.369,"end":290.593,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/072.mp3"},{"t":292.1,"end":292.724,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[grunts] (again)","de":"[grunzt] (wieder)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/073.mp3"},{"t":292.435,"end":294.259,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunts]","de":"[grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/074.mp3"},{"t":300.483,"end":302.451,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Hinokami Kagura:","de":"Hinokami Kagura:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/075.mp3"},{"t":302.2,"end":304.144,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Dance!","de":"Tanz!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/076.mp3"},{"t":304.064,"end":305.792,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/077.mp3"},{"t":305.826,"end":307.146,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"My sword!","de":"Mein Schwert!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/078.mp3"},{"t":308.228,"end":309.62,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"He'll break it!","de":"Er wird es kaputt machen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/079.mp3"},{"t":309.982,"end":313.246,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[effort grunts]","de":"[anstrengend grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/080.mp3"},{"t":313.902,"end":316.518,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"That was a strong headbutt.","de":"Das war ein heftiger Kopfstoß.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/081.mp3"},{"t":316.241,"end":318.017,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[grunts]","de":"[grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/082.mp3"},{"t":317.791,"end":320.383,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Damn you! Let go of me!","de":"Verdammt! Lass mich los!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/083.mp3"},{"t":320.64,"end":323.28,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"No good. [straining]","de":"Nicht gut. [sich anstrengen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/084.mp3"},{"t":323.059,"end":325.435,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"I can't get him to loosen his grip","de":"Ich kann ihn nicht dazu bringen, seinen Griff zu lockern","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/085.mp3"},{"t":335.095,"end":337.687,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunts softly]","de":"[grunzt leise]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/086.mp3"},{"t":337.349,"end":339.077,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Mr. Giyu!","de":"Herr Giyu!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/087.mp3"},{"t":339.143,"end":341.543,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[sighs]","de":"[seufzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/088.mp3"},{"t":341.924,"end":345.26,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"You're starting to get on my nerves.","de":"Du fängst an, mir auf die Nerven zu gehen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/089.mp3"},{"t":344.986,"end":347.962,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Thanks to you, my back is killing me now.","de":"Dank dir bringt mich mein Rücken jetzt um.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/090.mp3"},{"t":348.671,"end":351.791,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"I'm not fond of being hurled like a rag doll.","de":"Ich mag es nicht, wie eine Stoffpuppe geschleudert zu werden.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/091.mp3"},{"t":351.594,"end":353.706,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"I'm gonna make you pay.","de":"Ich werde dich bezahlen lassen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/092.mp3"},{"t":356.13,"end":360.906,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Personally, I'd rather not draw my sword if I can help it.","de":"Persönlich würde ich lieber nicht mein Schwert ziehen, wenn ich es verhindern kann.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/093.mp3"},{"t":360.93,"end":365.394,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"And I have a hard time justifying using deadly force if unnecessary.","de":"Und es fällt mir schwer, den Einsatz tödlicher Gewalt zu rechtfertigen, wenn dies unnötig ist.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/094.mp3"},{"t":366.168,"end":372.192,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"But at this moment, I'm against an opponent that demands everything from me.","de":"Aber in diesem Moment habe ich es mit einem Gegner zu tun, der mir alles abverlangt.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/095.mp3"},{"t":372.054,"end":376.398,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"In the short time we fought, my senses have been pushed past their limits.","de":"In der kurzen Zeit, in der wir gekämpft haben, wurden meine Sinne über ihre Grenzen gebracht.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/096.mp3"},{"t":376.754,"end":383.834,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"My dormant senses have been rudely awakened and are dragging me forward towards the enemy.","de":"Meine schlummernden Sinne wurden jäh geweckt und ziehen mich vorwärts auf den Feind zu.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/097.mp3"},{"t":383.674,"end":387.85,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"I now know how much it expands one potential","de":"Ich weiß jetzt, wie sehr es ein Potenzial erweitert","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/098.mp3"},{"t":387.803,"end":393.731,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"to have one's back against the wall with their sword raised in the face of death.","de":"mit dem Rücken zur Wand gelehnt und mit erhobenem Schwert angesichts des Todes.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/099.mp3"},{"t":393.439,"end":395.767,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[gasp]","de":"[keuch]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/100.mp3"},{"t":396.161,"end":398.225,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Mr. Giyu","de":"Herr Giyu","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/101.mp3"},{"t":408.311,"end":409.727,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/102.mp3"},{"t":410.887,"end":412.375,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/103.mp3"},{"t":415.133,"end":418.301,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"A mark appeared and his movements have gotten...","de":"Ein Mal erschien und seine Bewegungen wurden ...","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/104.mp3"},{"t":417.955,"end":419.347,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Faster!","de":"Schneller!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/105.mp3"},{"t":423.761,"end":426.089,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Water Breathing, Fourth Form:","de":"Wasseratmung, vierte Form:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/106.mp3"},{"t":425.862,"end":427.59,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Striking Tide!","de":"Auffällige Flut!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/107.mp3"},{"t":427.776,"end":430.704,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunts softly, chuckles]","de":"[grunzt leise, kichert]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/108.mp3"},{"t":430.339,"end":431.755,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"(You grunt in pain or disbelief?)","de":"(Sie grunzen vor Schmerz oder Unglauben?)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/109.mp3"},{"t":433.541,"end":434.861,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Ha!","de":"Ha!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/110.mp3"},{"t":435.416,"end":436.64,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[grunts]","de":"[grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/111.mp3"},{"t":441.345,"end":443.553,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"They're both so fast.","de":"Sie sind beide so schnell.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/112.mp3"},{"t":443.087,"end":446.279,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Mr. Giyu's speed increased with the mark,","de":"Mr. Giyus Geschwindigkeit nahm mit der Marke zu,","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/113.mp3"},{"t":445.945,"end":448.273,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"but Akaza adapted to it instantly.","de":"aber Akaza passte sich sofort daran an.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/114.mp3"},{"t":448.361,"end":450.137,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Tyah!","de":"Tyah!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/115.mp3"},{"t":450.071,"end":453.839,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Don't tell me that's all you're capable of!","de":"Sag mir nicht, dass das alles ist, wozu du fähig bist!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/116.mp3"},{"t":453.56,"end":455.6,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[Groans angrily]","de":"[Stöhnt wütend]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/117.mp3"},{"t":457.054,"end":462.214,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[groans] (you will be groaning along side Giyu so I hope you can tell the difference) (Also the last grunt is yours)","de":"[stöhnt] (Du wirst neben Giyu stöhnen, also hoffe ich, dass du den Unterschied erkennen kannst) (Auch das letzte Grunzen gehört dir)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/118.mp3"},{"t":457.114,"end":461.122,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[groans] (you will be groaning along side Akaza so I hope you can tell the difference)","de":"[stöhnt] (Du wirst neben Akaza stöhnen, also hoffe ich, dass du den Unterschied erkennen kannst)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/119.mp3"},{"t":462.387,"end":466.059,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Show me more! Don't you dare hold back!","de":"Zeig mir mehr! Wagen Sie es nicht, sich zurückzuhalten!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/120.mp3"},{"t":466.319,"end":469.583,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[grunts]","de":"[grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/121.mp3"},{"t":476.152,"end":477.976,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/122.mp3"},{"t":477.779,"end":480.443,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[growls]","de":"[knurrt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/123.mp3"},{"t":480.383,"end":482.663,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Tch!","de":"Tch!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/124.mp3"},{"t":482.233,"end":483.697,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt] (again)","de":"[grunzen] (wieder)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/125.mp3"},{"t":483.561,"end":486.969,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"hut hyuh tyuh","de":"Hütte hyuh tyuh","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/126.mp3"},{"t":489.188,"end":490.868,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"HAHH!","de":"HAHH!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/127.mp3"},{"t":494.921,"end":496.481,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Tenth Form:","de":"Zehnte Form:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/128.mp3"},{"t":496.344,"end":498.72,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Constant Flux!","de":"Konstanter Fluss!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/129.mp3"},{"t":505.516,"end":508.276,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[yelling]","de":"[schreit]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/130.mp3"},{"t":512.895,"end":514.359,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunts in pain]","de":"[grunzt vor Schmerz]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/131.mp3"},{"t":515.478,"end":517.254,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Seventh Form:","de":"Siebte Form:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/132.mp3"},{"t":517.023,"end":519.111,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Drop Ripple Thrust!","de":"Ripple Thrust fallen lassen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/133.mp3"},{"t":518.744,"end":520.808,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Destructive Death:","de":"Zerstörerischer Tod:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/134.mp3"},{"t":520.497,"end":521.841,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Disorder!","de":"Unordnung!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/135.mp3"},{"t":532.197,"end":535.293,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Mr. Giyu! Akaza!","de":"Herr Giyu! Akaza!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/136.mp3"},{"t":536.701,"end":538.933,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Calm down!","de":"Beruhige dich!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/137.mp3"},{"t":542.311,"end":545.239,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Think! Don't panic.","de":"Denken! Keine Panik.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/138.mp3"},{"t":544.923,"end":547.491,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Whatever you do, don't lose focus.","de":"Was auch immer Sie tun, verlieren Sie nicht den Fokus.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/139.mp3"},{"t":547.652,"end":549.572,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunts]","de":"[grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/140.mp3"},{"t":549.196,"end":553.012,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Why is it that Akaza's attacks are always so accurate!","de":"Warum sind Akazas Angriffe immer so präzise?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/141.mp3"},{"t":552.732,"end":554.46,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"Tch, Hyup!","de":"Tch, Hyup!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/142.mp3"},{"t":554.066,"end":556.803,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"How is he able to response to attacks from his blind spots?","de":"Wie kann er auf Angriffe aus seinen blinden Flecken reagieren?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/143.mp3"},{"t":554.296,"end":554.992,"chars":[1],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt] (ignore Tanjiro's dialogue here)","de":"[grunzen] (ignoriere Tanjiros Dialog hier)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/144.mp3"},{"t":554.33,"end":555.002,"chars":[3],"who":"Giyu","text":"[grunt] (ignore Tanjiro's dialogue here)","de":"[grunzen] (ignoriere Tanjiros Dialog hier)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil2/lines/145.mp3"}]}